    "settings.allowBluetoothMics" : {
      "comment" : "Toggle label in Settings → Recording. When on, the app allows Bluetooth headphones (AirPods etc.) to be used as the recording microphone. Off by default because BT input forces the HFP profile (16kHz mono, telephony quality).",
