    "SteadyEye needs camera and microphone access to record your videos. You can enable them later in Settings if you change your mind." : {
      "comment" : "Body text on the onboarding permission-explainer screen. Pairs with the 'Camera & microphone access needed' heading. Shown when either camera or mic (or both) were denied — the explainer guides the user to Settings to flip whichever toggle is missing.",
